    "body": "For us maintainers it's really hard to judge which features of the admin interface people are using/not using.\n\nIt'd be nice to add opt-out analytics where we can collect (anonymized, obviously) information about what people are doing with the Keystone admin interface so we can adapt to what users are actually doing!\n\n_Yes I realize this isn't a bug, but this wouldn't make sense to be on Product Pains since it's mostly maintainer-facing_\n",
